WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.560
Join neighbouring shops into one larger unit for a big brand, or divide one into smaller units.

2
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:14.930
A brand needs more space than one shop? Join two neighbours. Open the first one.

3
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.580
Merge or split is at the bottom of the unit page.

4
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.970
Choose Merge with other units.

5
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:31.750
Tick the neighbour that joins it.

6
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:38.750
Give the new unit a code, or leave it empty to make one from the old codes.

7
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.790
Merge.

8
00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:49.290
One unit with the combined area and list rent. The old units are kept in its history.

9
00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:53.130
The plan redraws the shop as one space.

10
00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:58.960
Splitting works the other way round.

11
00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:07.410
The parts are suggested half and half. Change the codes and areas, add a third part if needed, and split.
